<Defs>
  <!--
    The first name is written again as an explicit nickname ("First 'First' Last"), so a Vivi is always shown by the first name.
    Without it, NameTriple shows the first or last name by hash parity, and the last name pool is small.
    Each vivi_name_* rule sets a tag that only the matching vivi_nick_* rule requires, so the nickname repeats the chosen words.
  -->
